activity Conduct Risk Assessment
activity Develop Compliance Plan
activity Approve Compliance Plan
activity Review Compliance Plan
activity Implement Controls
activity Train Employees
activity Monitor Compliance
activity Take Corrective Action
activity Report Violations
activity Investigate Violations
bind Conduct Risk Assessment: Risk Level, Assessment Score
bind Develop Compliance Plan: Plan Status
bind Approve Compliance Plan: Plan Status
bind Implement Controls: Control Type
bind Train Employees: Training Hours
bind Monitor Compliance: Compliance Status
bind Take Corrective Action: 
bind Report Violations: Number of Violations, Reporting Channel
bind Investigate Violations: Violation Severity, Financial Impact
bind Review Compliance Plan: Plan Status
Risk Level: Low, Medium, High
Assessment Score: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Plan Status: Draft, Approved, Implemented
Control Type: Preventative, Detective, Corrective
Training Hours: integer between 0 and 40
Compliance Status: Compliant, Non-Compliant, Pending
Number of Violations: integer between 0 and 100
Reporting Channel: Email, Phone, Online Portal
Violation Severity: integer between 1 and 5
Financial Impact: float between 0.0 and 1000000.0
Init[Conduct Risk Assessment] | |
Succession[Develop Compliance Plan, Approve Compliance Plan] | | |
Alternate Succession[Approve Compliance Plan, Review Compliance Plan] | | |0,365,d
Response[Conduct Risk Assessment, Implement Controls] |A.Risk Level is High | |0,30,d
Existence[Train Employees] | |
Response[Monitor Compliance, Take Corrective Action] |A.Compliance Status is Non-Compliant | |0,7,d
Response[Report Violations, Investigate Violations] | | |
Succession[Investigate Violations, Take Corrective Action] | | |
Response[Report Violations, Review Compliance Plan] |A.Number of Violations > 5 | |0,14,d
Response[Investigate Violations, Review Compliance Plan] |A.Financial Impact > 10000 | |0,3,d